{%- comment -%}
  The brand typefaces, self hosted. Generated by scripts/fetch-fonts.mjs, so
  edit STACK in that script and re run it rather than editing this file.

  Rendered from ss-tokens.liquid, which every Sleep Shop section renders, so a
  section cannot be added that quietly falls back to Times New Roman. The
  repeated declarations cost nothing: the browser downloads each file once,
  and identical blocks compress to almost nothing over the wire.

  latin subset only. 5 files, 113 KB in total.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Playfair Display";
    font-style: normal;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-display: swap;
    src: url({{ 'ss-playfair-display-400-latin.woff2' | asset_url }}) format("woff2");
    unicode-range: U+0000-00FF, U+0131, U+0152-0153, U+02BB-02BC, U+02C6, U+02DA, U+02DC, U+0304, U+0308, U+0329, U+2000-206F, U+20AC, U+2122, U+2191, U+2193, U+2212, U+2215, U+FEFF, U+FFFD;
  }
  @font-face {
    font-family: "Cormorant Garamond";
